===Pronoun===
'''kumpikin''' (''singular'')

# {{label|fi|indefinite}} [[both|Both]].
#: '''''Kumpikin''' on punainen.''
#: '''''Kummatkin''' ovat punaisia.''
#:: '''''Both''' are red.''

====Inflection====
* The instructive plural is mainly used as an adverb.
